@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Product: daftar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Product: detail Northwind
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### Category: buat sebelum product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"category_id":30000,"category_name":"Workshop","description":"Kategori latihan"}

### Category: daftar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Category: detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/30000

### Category: ubah
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/30000
Content-Type: application/json

{"category_name":"Workshop Baru","description":"Kategori latihan diperbarui"}

### Product: buat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"product_id":30000,"product_name":"Produk Workshop","category_id":30000,"supplier_id":null,"unit_price":10,"units_in_stock":20,"discontinued":0}

### Product: ubah (PUT mengganti semua field yang dikelola API)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/30000
Content-Type: application/json

{"product_name":"Produk Workshop Baru","category_id":30000,"supplier_id":null,"unit_price":12.5,"units_in_stock":30,"discontinued":0}

### Category: masih dipakai product; diharapkan 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/30000

### Product: hapus data latihan; diharapkan 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/30000

### Category: hapus setelah product; diharapkan 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/30000

### Order: daftar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### Order: buat menggunakan produk dataset Northwind
# Mengurangi stok nyata. Jalankan sekali, sesuaikan ID order jika sudah dipakai.
# Produk 1 dan 2 harus tersedia, aktif, dan stok cukup.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"order_id":30000,"customer_id":"ALFKI","items":[{"product_id":1,"quantity":2,"discount":0},{"product_id":2,"quantity":3,"discount":0.1}]}

### Order: detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/30000
